      "type": "event",
      "date": "2026-01-23T11:48:00.000Z",
      "title": "Advani Hotels & Resorts (India) Limited Declares First Interim Dividend for the Financial Year 2025–2026, Payable on February 20, 2026",
      "body": "Advani Hotels & Resorts (India) Limited at its board meeting held on January 23, 2026 declared the First Interim Dividend @ 50% i.e. INR 1/- (Rupee One only) per Equity Share of face value of INR 2/- each for the Financial Year 2025–2026, payable to the Equity Shareholders of the Company whose names appear in the Register of Members or in the records of the Depositories as Beneficial Owners of Equity Shares as on, January 30, 2026, being the Record Date fixed for the purpose, with the Interim Dividend to be remitted by, February 20, 2026.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "45",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
